                                                                     "Domestic hot water demand. Expressed as qudt:QuantityValue, typically in kWh/m²·year."@en ;
                                                        rdfs:label "DHW demand"@en ,
                                                                   "demanda de ACS"@es .


###  https://edint.es/def/certificado-energetico#dhwEnergySource
<https://edint.es/def/certificado-energetico#dhwEnergySource> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                                              rdfs:domain <https://edint.es/def/certificado-energetico#EnergyCertificate> ;
                                                              rdfs:range [ owl:intersectionOf ( <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>
